---
/** Brand lockup from the mockup: seal | divider | green tile | wordmark.
    The minimal logo is white artwork, so it sits on the dark tile. */
---

<header class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
  <img
    src="/dlsau-logo.svg"
    alt="De La Salle Araneta University seal"
    width="64"
    height="64"
    class="size-14 shrink-0 sm:size-16"
  />
  <span class="h-12 w-px bg-sage-400/70" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="grid size-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-forest-700 p-3 shadow-soft sm:size-16 sm:p-3.5">
    <img
      src="/lostlink-logo-minimal.png"
      alt=""
      width="48"
      height="48"
      class="size-full object-contain"
    />
  </span>
  <div class="min-w-0">
    <p class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-none text-forest-700 sm:text-[1.75rem]">
      LostLink
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[0.8rem] leading-none text-sage-600">
      DLSAU Web-based Lost and Found System
    </p>
  </div>
</header>